"""vss_ctl.py -- a FIXTURE of the kind 2 contract's Python module (Phase 8 specification 2.4), for tests/test_sdv_ctl.py.

Not generated, never loaded by anything but the tests. The kind 2 contract is generated by sdv/vss/generate.py from
WP1b on; until then the tests of sdv/ctl use this module, in exactly the generated module's names. Synthetic values
only: the seven staticUIDs are made up (the ControlCommand layer has never been generated), the digest is the FNV-1
32 of those, and the constants and profile rows are stand-ins in the generated shape. The limits are the shape of the
gate's public nominal configuration and the UIDs made up; no value is a measurement or a run's result. The integration
stage's contract test holds the C fixture of the monitor's tests (tests/fixtures/ctl-c/vss_ctl.h) to these same values.
"""

